        "v": 5,
        "title": "flexShrink: 0 on CLI referral banner and card",
        "summary": "Added flexShrink: 0 to FreebuffReferralBanner and WaitingRoomScreen components to prevent layout squashing in height-starved landing columns. This ensures bordered copy and action buttons do not overlap status lines or preceding text. The change also refines the row reservation logic for the GLM referral banner to accurately account for bordered button heights (3 rows). Updated files include cli/src/components/freebuff-referral-banner.tsx and cli/src/components/waiting-room-screen.tsx.",
        "significance": "minor",
        "at": "2026-09-14T16:05:10.335Z"
      },
      "eli5": {
        "text": "Your terminal can now keep the referral banner and its bordered buttons from getting squished into the text above when the window is short. The fix tells the landing layout to hold its height so the copy button and the \"Use GLM 5.2\" card stay spaced out instead of overlapping the lines next to them. You would see the banner sit cleanly under the status line instead of its border bleeding into the row above. This is live today for the full-tier landing screen.",
