        "title": "Refactor eval to deserializeHandleSteps",
        "summary": "Introduce `deserializeHandleSteps` helper in `run-programmatic-step.ts` to replace direct `eval` calls for string-based `handleSteps` templates. This isolates deserialization logic and improves type safety via `HandleStepsFn`. Scope limited to `packages/agent-runtime/src/run-programmatic-step.ts`. The helper casts `eval` to a typed function to safely return the generator.",
